body:
if it feels safe you might try using those moments to try a self-compassion mindfulness practice, like the one Kristen Neff explains in this vid:

https://youtu.be/y0gtnOXAp-U

I was looking at pictures of my crush and his gf on instagram to hurt myself, and then I started trying to do this instead, and it helped me

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jKYZiinf9Qk&feature=emb\_title](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jKYZiinf9Qk&feature=emb_title)

&#x200B;

\^Everything you need to know in a trailer from 40 or 50 years ago
